# Flutter Frontend Rules

The app must feel premium, modern and production-ready.

Mandatory:
- Responsive layouts
- Smooth animations
- Proper spacing system
- Consistent typography
- Reusable widgets
- Error boundaries
- Offline support
- State persistence
- Skeleton loaders
- Retry buttons
- Empty states
- Dark mode support
- Navigation consistency
- Prevent screen overflow
- Avoid widget rebuild issues
- Proper Provider architecture

Never:
- Use ugly default Material UI
- Use inconsistent colors
- Use unaligned widgets
- Use random padding values
- Leave screens incomplete
- Leave buttons without action
